# DEEPX dx-runtime one-line install — pinned compatible versions
# Updated on each dx-runtime release. Consumed by oneline-install.sh.
# SHA256_* hashes must be regenerated whenever the corresponding *_TAG/*_URL
# changes — a stale hash hard-fails the install (checksum mismatch).
